    <sys:String x:Key="L.Help.app.diagnostics.logs.Body">- **Key and click sending**: keys reaching the wrong client, or modifier keys that stick.&#x0A;- **Client switching**: hotkeys that skip a client or switch to the wrong one.&#x0A;- **Window events**: thumbnails that don't appear, or follow the wrong window.&#x0A;- **Thumbnail drawing**: black or frozen thumbnails.&#x0A;- **Alerts**: alerts that fire when they shouldn't, or not at all.</sys:String>
